<h2 class="mb-4"><i class="bi bi-gear-fill me-2"></i>Cài Đặt</h2>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-header py-2" style="background: #2d3748; border-radius: 0;">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-key-fill me-2"></i>Credit API</h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">URL API</label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-link-45deg"></i></span>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="creditUrlInput"
                            placeholder="https://creditmls2026video.toolshopee.vn/api/sign">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">API Key</label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i></span>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="creditKeyInput" placeholder="X-API-Key...">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" onclick="toggleCreditKeyVisibility()"
                            title="Hiện/Ẩn">
                            <i class="bi bi-eye" id="creditKeyEyeIcon"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="saveCreditSettings()">
                        <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1"></i>Lưu cài đặt
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" onclick="loadCreditSettings()">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i>Tải lại
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm" onclick="checkCreditBalance()" id="creditBalanceBtn">
                        <i class="bi bi-wallet2 me-1"></i>Kiểm tra số dư
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div id="creditBalanceResult" class="mt-2" style="display:none;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h6 class="text-muted mb-3"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>Hướng dẫn</h6>
                <ul class="small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li><strong>URL API</strong>: Địa chỉ URL API</li>
                    <li><strong>API Key</strong>: Key xác thực.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-header py-2" style="background: #37474f; border-radius: 0;">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-link-45deg me-2"></i>API URL Key 1</h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">URL Domain</label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-globe"></i></span>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="apiUrlKey1Input" placeholder="https://domain.com">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text">Nhập domain API. Để trống sẽ dùng giá trị mặc định.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="saveApiUrlKey1()">
                        <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1"></i>Lưu
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" onclick="loadApiUrlKey1()">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i>Tải lại
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-header py-2" style="background: #2e7d32; border-radius: 0;">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network-fill me-2"></i>Tích hợp HomeProxy (Proxy Tĩnh)
                </h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">API Token (Bearer)</label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i></span>
                        <input type="password" class="form-control" id="homeproxyTokenInput"
                            placeholder="homepx42152_e21c0b975d1093642c0a6e95bd760a49a4f7bf5a2e67ba971535c18940288b1e">
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button"
                            onclick="toggleHomeProxyTokenVisibility()" title="Hiện/Ẩn">
                            <i class="bi bi-eye" id="homeproxyTokenEyeIcon"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text">Token API của HomeProxy. Dùng để tự động đồng bộ danh sách proxy tĩnh của bạn.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">x-merchant-id</label>
                    <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
                        <span class="input-group-text"><i class="bi bi-person-badge"></i></span>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" id="homeproxyMerchantIdInput"
                            placeholder="56cf5b7e-37ec-4589-8f5b-51ff94694126">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-text">Mã Merchant ID từ trang API Docs của HomeProxy.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="saveHomeProxyToken()">
                        <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1"></i>Lưu Cấu Hình
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm" onclick="syncHomeProxyProxies()" id="syncHomeProxyBtn">
                        <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat me-1"></i>Đồng bộ Proxy
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div id="homeproxySyncResult" class="mt-2 small" style="display:none;"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid var(--primary, #0d6efd);">
            <div class="card-header py-2 bg-primary text-white">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill me-2"></i>Cơ Chế Xếp Hàng Proxy (Proxy Queue Lock)</h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="form-check form-switch mb-2">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="settingsProxyQueueLockSwitch" checked onchange="toggleProxyQueueLock(this.checked)">
                    <label class="form-check-label fw-bold text-dark" for="settingsProxyQueueLockSwitch">
                        Sử dụng Proxy Queue Lock (Xếp hàng giãn cách 8s giữa các luồng cùng IP Proxy)
                    </label>
                </div>
                <div class="alert alert-light border small text-muted mb-0">
                    <ul class="mb-0 ps-3">
                        <li><strong>Tích chọn (ON - Khuyên dùng)</strong>: Xếp hàng chờ giãn cách 8 giây cho các tài khoản dùng chung 1 IP Proxy. Chống tuyệt đối lỗi 429 Too Many Requests và 503 Server quá tải.</li>
                        <li><strong>Bỏ tích (OFF - Chế độ ngày xưa)</strong>: Tất cả các luồng cùng post tự do và đồng thời 100%. Proxy chia đều cho các tài khoản.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-header py-2" style="background: #1565c0; border-radius: 0;">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-hdd-network me-2"></i>Kiểm Tra Proxy</h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Danh sách proxy (mỗi dòng 1 proxy)</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="proxyCheckInput" rows="6"
                        placeholder="IP:PORT&#10;IP:PORT:USER:PASS&#10;103.1.2.3:8080:admin:pass123"></textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" onclick="checkProxies()" id="checkProxyBtn">
                        <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge me-1"></i>Check Proxy
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm" onclick="importProxiesDirectly()" id="importProxyBtn">
                        <i class="bi bi-download me-1"></i>Import Proxy
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm" onclick="clearAllProxies()" id="clearProxyBtn">
                        <i class="bi bi-trash me-1"></i>Xóa Proxy
                    </button>
                    <span id="proxyCheckSummary" class="small"></span>
                </div>
                <div id="proxyCheckResults" class="mt-3" style="display:none;">
                    <div class="table-responsive" style="max-height:250px;overflow-y:auto;">
                        <table class="table table-sm table-bordered mb-0">
                            <thead class="table-light">
                                <tr>
                                    <th style="width:40px">#</th>
                                    <th>Proxy</th>
                                    <th style="width:80px">Ping</th>
                                    <th style="width:100px">Trạng thái</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="proxyCheckTable"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-left: 3px solid #1565c0;">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h6 class="text-muted mb-3"><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>Hướng dẫn Proxy</h6>
                <ul class="small mb-0" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li><strong>Format</strong>: <code>IP:PORT</code> hoặc <code>IP:PORT:USERNAME:PASSWORD</code></li>
                    <li><strong>Check</strong>: Hệ thống gửi request qua proxy tới httpbin.org để kiểm tra kết nối.</li>
                    <li><strong>Ping</strong>: Thời gian phản hồi (ms). Dưới 2000ms là tốt.</li>
                    <li><strong>Kết quả</strong>: Xanh = sống, Đỏ = chết/timeout/sai auth.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4">
            <div class="card-header py-2" style="background: #0088cc; border-radius: 0;">
                <h6 class="mb-0 text-white"><i class="bi bi-telegram me-2"></i>Báo Cáo Qua Telegram</h6>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fw-semibold small">Trình Cấu Hình Bot Token</label>
                        <div class="input-group input-group-sm">
